{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂1の乃木坂ヲタク\nかりんの発音 上り坂↑\n伊藤かりん↑です(っｴ`o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/03/15/2993097/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"純奈とシーに行ってきたよ♡\nインクレディブルとイラスティガールと\n写真撮れて幸せなんだよ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ロッツォたんパーカー着て\nロッツォたん連れて行って\n幸せだったよ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/03/15/2993097/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほらこの満面の笑み(｡･ω･｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アルバム特典イベントのクルージングに\nお越し下さった皆様\nありがとうございました♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/03/15/2993097/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結果は優勝♡\nひめちゃん♡あやねちゃん♡\nそしてBチームのファンの皆様♡\nやったね！嬉しいね！♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あんなに長時間ファンの方と\nお話しする機会ってなかなか無いから\nすごく仲良くなれたと\n私は思っています♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/03/15/2993097/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"船からの夜景はとても綺麗でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"正直夜景とかあんまり興味ないんだけど、\nこういう\n埠頭とか工場夜景は好きみたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてアルバム特典イベント\nチェキ会ありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/03/15/2993097/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンの方とメンバーの間に\n箱みたいな仕切りがあったんだけど\nわりと距離近くて緊張した(   ´ω`   )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなとのチェキ\n私も欲しかったなー⸜(  ⌓̈ )⸝"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"撮った皆様、よかったら\n大切にしてください♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/03/15/2993097/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誕生日が私の指定した日(13日ごと)\nの方のみ僭越ながら\nお祝いさせていただきます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/03/15/2993097/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3.13 birthday!!!!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"minamiさん\nmamoruさん\n番長さん\nしおりさん\n町田翔平さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私たちと一緒に素敵な1年に\nしましょうね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/03/15/2993097/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/03/15/2993097/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/03/15/2993097/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誕生日次回予告 3/26"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/03/15/2993097/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"typ